  "body": "Beautifully designed for contemporary living, this stylish home in the sought-after Strathmill community of Orewa combines comfort, functionality, and easy-care living. Set on an approximately 197sqm section, it offers a smart opportunity for first-home buyers, young families, professionals, or investors.\r\n\r\nProperty Highlights:\r\n\r\n- Light-filled open-plan living brings the kitchen, dining, and living areas together, creating a warm and welcoming hub for everyday life, family time, and entertaining.\r\n\r\n- A well-appointed kitchen features sleek cabinetry, generous bench space, and a practical layout designed for effortless meal preparation.\r\n\r\n- Seamless indoor-outdoor flow creates an inviting space for BBQs, family gatherings, outdoor dining, or relaxing in the sunshine.\r\n\r\n- The master suite offers a peaceful retreat complete with its own private ensuite and generous walk-in wardrobe.\r\n\r\n- Two additional bedrooms provide flexibility for children, guests, or a home office, adapting easily to changing lifestyle needs, served by a family bathroom.\r\n\r\n- Single internal-access garage combines secure parking with an integrated laundry area and valuable storage, adding everyday convenience and functionality.\r\n\r\n\r\nLocated within the fast-growing Strathmill community, this home enjoys the convenience of being close to Orewa Beach, cafés, restaurants, shopping, schools, parks, and motorway connections. Surrounded by quality homes and a welcoming neighbourhood atmosphere, it offers the ideal balance of coastal lifestyle and modern convenience.\r\n\r\nWhether you're stepping onto the property ladder, looking for a comfortable family home, or seeking a low-maintenance investment, this brand-new Strathmill residence offers an appealing combination of modern comfort, practical design, and coastal convenience.\r\n\r\nContact Team Sabrina today to arrange your private viewing and discover all this home has to offer.",
